    "de": [
      "Im Rahmen des Programms Vichy Vitalité bietet Le Temple du Sport zwei Schnupperkurse an: Kravmaga.   \r\nInformationen und Anmeldung per Telefon."
    ],
    "en": [
      "As part of the Vichy Vitality program, Le Temple du Sport is offering two discovery sessions: Kravmaga.   \r\nInformation and registration by telephone."
    ],
